    <!--
      Every shape below is kept inside a circle of radius 31 around the centre of the 108 unit
      canvas. A circular or pill launcher mask only guarantees the middle 66 units, and the
      Android 12 splash screen is tighter still at roughly the middle 65, so anything further out
      than that comes back to the user with a corner sliced off. The old mark drew the whole
      player tile edge to edge and lost its corners in both places; the tile is now the background
      layer's job, and the foreground carries only the screen, the play triangle and the progress
      bar that the mark has always been about.
